    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú tám oo waawuti'iimár Hoshea garmoó Ela, waawutmoó Israeli, Hesekia garmoó Ahasi waawutmoó Yuda waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár nee kooán. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy mibeeri tsár nee gwaleél baraá gixsár Yerusalemuro. Aayoorós a Abi dasír Sekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE hhooa gana tleéhh adór Daudi baabuúwós wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kiteeridaá gawaá gongoama' awa munguaá lama kiwa sluufmiisi nee uheemidae gina feé/, nee slaqsoó munguú Ashera guna tsaát. Inós slaqsayduú dayshamo, kudá' aáng Mose aa tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat, kudá' ta babay Nehushtani, guri suwawaá'. Asma ay qoomaadá' múk Israeli dayshamoodá' taa tleéhh nee Mose ngun mooyángw tsuú' i da/a/aná' as nguwa ilaiwawa/iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli guna ló'wa haratlintií'. Baraá yaamaá Yudawo waawutmoó adór inós i kaahh, tam dír waawitaádá' aa giirini, laqaá kudá' aa waawuti'in aluuwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guna eehár ar inkihhimu, sleeme gwa geexayká, inós hara'ayaadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa haniís dír Mose gana óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a dinkwa nee inós, guri aleesleemú i haniís baraá umuú gár aqo tleehhi. Inós kuwa sawaawuti'in nee waawutmoó Ashuru gana sií', nee nguwa sagadiyuusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós múk Filisti slaqwaraaro guna baál nee guri haraadáh baraá gixsaduín iimír Gasa ay ayeemaá inslawaydá', iimír iimu/úngw /Aampaá xuuma ay gixsadaá taa tleéhh ar koo/ír gawit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú tsiyáhh oo waawuti'iimár Hesekia, sleeme qoomaarihe Hoshea garmoó Ela kureeraá faanqw gaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimár yaamaá Israeliro, Shalmanesa waawutmoó Ashuru gixsár Samaria gana i haratláy, gari harweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesoó kurkú tame múk Ashuru gixsár Samaria gari hayóh. Qoomaarihe Hesekia baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeraá lahhoó' gaa aáy, nee qoomaarihe waawutmoó Israeli kureeraá gwaleél gaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmoó Ashuru múk Israeli guri haásaáng wa ar tláy ay yaamaá Ashuru, bahh'ale giri qaás baraá gixsár Hala nee ar Habori, nee bahh'ale baraá bihhaá yaaér Gosani, nee gixsadaá yaamaá Media.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ina tleehharút asma múk Israeli afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, nga iiárií qaasi'iiká. Inooín al'axweesantós ngina geexayé', laqaá afór Mose sleeme nga iiárií qaasi'iiká, sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kudá' aa hara'ayín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár kurkú mibaá nee tsiyáhh oo waawuti'iimár Hesekia, waawutmo Senakeribu oo Ashuru gixsadaá Yuda sleémeero kudá' taa tleéhh ar koo/ír gawden gina i haratláy, nee giri hayóh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia waawutmoó Yuda afo gari ya/aáw amór Senakeribu baraadaá Lakishi, guri báy, «Gám aníng aga dakuús. Na'amaamís, slaqwara sihhtisek, nee aníng umuú gár ta sla'a ngi haniís.» Waawutmoó Ashuru iri oó', «Hesekia waawutmoó Yuda kílor kume mibaangw ar peésa nee kílor kumuú wák ar sahaábu ngi haniisi.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia peésaadá' sleémeero baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ dirii', nee tidár baraá doó waawutmowo gari haniís dír Senakeribu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám sleeme sahaábudá' baraá afér Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i dirii' nee sahaábu inós aa afkú maandár sliík sleémeero guna haniís dír waawutmo Senakeribu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmoó Ashuru geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuse nee geeraharusmoó úr oo askaári nee geeraharusmoó múk taa karmuumúy dinkwa nee slaqwaruusér yaariir, gari ya/aáw amór Lakishi wá ale ay amór waawutmo Hesekia baraá Yerusalemu, niri hardihiyé' baraá Yerusalemu. Inooín niwa hardihiyé' nay sihhitiyé' bihhaá maparír ma'aay tidár bihhaá loohidá' ur, ar amór didár hhuuntsitór kaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia nguwa ateetiyé', inooín kina al'áy nee Eliakimu garmoó Hilkia kudá' doó waawutmoó sagesihhmiít, nee Shebna kuduú goousmo, nee Yoa garmoó Asafu goousmoó muruú inslaslángwá hariím. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmoodá' úr oo mukdá' taa karmuumúy iri oó', «Hesekia bawaak, adoorí an adoodá' waawutmoó úr oo Ashuru i kaahi, ‹Gaasíng taa harahhíf a milá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy ka xu' axweesantá tawo a qeeruúwo nee an /uuruúwo baraá slaqwaraaro? Heesíng a heemá taa harahhíf tam aníng iri áhh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám qaytsiít daxta múk Misri una harahhíf, inooín a adór hhartá aa qet, tidá' hee birnga ar qadiís gun dawa mút. Adoorí an adoodá' waawutmo Farao oo Misri i dirii'i dír mukdá' sleémeero inós gu harahhifa.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala tam i beera, ‹Atén AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén un harahhifaán,› xuaak adór munguúsíng tar kudá' Hesekia kiteeriwós kudá' gawaá gongoama' awa ilahhooa hanmis ngira fe/iít, múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu guri báy, ‹Mungú sluufmisaak dír geeraá kitangwduú ilahhooa oo baraá Yerusalemurí dirií'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé' daxta axweesé' nee aakooeé' waawutmoó Ashuru, daqaní aníng farasuú kume tsár ngu haniís, bar kuungá' múk faras gu i tsa/ám u koondá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaá kuungá' heé wák oo niiná baraá sagadiyuusér aakooeene adór kur alií ki/isa' a adoomá, bartaqae kuungá' gár ta koonda' i káhh, aqo múk Misri un harahhifá', nee mukdá' farasuuín gu madiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe, xáy, kuungá' ka xua' aníng nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ti kaahi koomanaakáhe as yaamuuhúng ngiwa i haratlaw, nee ngiwa qwaarees. AAKOÓ MUNGÚ an heé iga bay, ‹Yaamusingá' i haratlaweek nee ki hhaamís.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
