            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' úr oo múk taa karmuumuyi iri oó', «Xáy, aakooeé' aníng ina ya/aáwi dír aakoohúng nee dirhúng kilós? Ala iga ya/awikáhe dír mukdá' gawaá ságw koo/írí dirií', kudá' sleémeero taa sakwasleemuút dinkwa nee kuungá', /o/oduuín ngiwa /ayiya' nee sooxaín ngiwa kilooín wahiya'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy heedaádá' úr oo múk taa karmuumúy iri tseé' ar afór ur, nee iri axweés ar tsifrír Ebrania, iri oó', «Iia qaasaak, gár waawutmoó úr oo Ashuru i kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‹Adoorí an adoodá' waawutmo i kaahi, kuungá' mutunduwa al/agín nee Hesekia, inós kuungá' nu baloó aleeslayká /iisaro gawaá dabaeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' Hesekia munduwa tawo al/agín as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa harahhifa' iwa kaahi, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' nu ba/amis, nee gixsarí waawutmoó Ashuru ga hayohiiká.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' Hesekia mu iiárií qamimara', asma waawutmoó Ashuru i kaahi, ‹Kuungá' wayda koomaak dir'eé' wa ale, ti hanise' gawaá dabaeé'. Daqaní dír kuungae umuú heewo mamaá sabiíbuuwós gi /aay kilós alé, nee mamaá /aantsírós gi /aay, nee ma'aá hhalaangós gi wahán, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ay dír aníng kuungá' nuy huúw amór yaamaá saawá' awa adór koohúng kuká', yaamaá balaangw nee difaái, yaamaá mikaátér koomá' nee qamaá sabiiíbuuwo, yaamaá xaa'aá seituúni nee awa danér koomá', as daqaní kuungá' tawa hota', tawa baloó qatla'aaká. Hesekia kuungá' burnu al/agín, kuungá' mu iiárií qaasara' iwa kaahi: AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuungá' nu ba/amis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, baraá munguaá xoordaá hatlae awa muk'ín ngwa /iisiyé' i dayá'a gawaá dabaá waawutmoó Ashuruwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, munguaá Hamati nee awa Arpadi i amoomá? Munguaá Sefarfaimu nee awa Hena nee awa Ifa i amoomá? Xáy, gixsár Samaria nga ba/amisí'i gawaá dabaeene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, baraá munguaá yaamu sleémeerowo oo yaamuuwós gaa tuu/ gawaá dabaeene i deéro? Daqaní bir deer AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sleeme gixsár Yerusalemu ga ba/amis gawaá dabaeene.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
