          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muu ina qartlamiít tam heé /aymu gwa tlaaxw i kaahh, asma waawutmo Hesekia mu guna báy, «Axweesantós ma tlaxwaara'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Eliakimu garmoó Hilkia kudaádá' doó waawutmoó sagesihhmiít, nee Shebna goousmo, nee Yoa garmoó Asafu goousmoó muruú inslaslángw wa hariím, tlabaaín kiri feehhamiís, niri amór Hesekia kayé', kángw heedá' úr oo múk taa karmuumúy aa káhh nguri ooiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
